  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following is a positive overlap that leads to bonding?<br />\r<br />\r(I) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/qbldaxjcktodyxodceqcozfequhatclftzurasjhnqllswfabf.jpeg\" /><br />\r<br />\r(II) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/uliwopjfwkelpxgudsmyylozqubszcbiqkuzayqmsdvxyardip.jpeg\" /><br />\r<br />\r(III) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/qmmsobdwcriktxokbwmfcdcwcxtfirydwnqmtmejnckzbakxid.jpeg\" /><br />\r<br />\r(IV) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/erbbuvqfchdirphmiwvflplzioogemvbefqolyrjkjeagsulgx.jpeg\" />",
